@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-68 - Open Chat Widget (Guest)

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-68
FE -> API: POST /chat/conversations
API -> Service: Execute Open Chat Widget (Guest)
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Chat widget mở, sẵn sàng gửi tin nhắn

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Chưa đăng nhập, mở chat widget
Post: Chat widget mở, sẵn sàng gửi tin nhắn
Main flow:
1. Guest bấm vào chat icon góc phải
2. System hiển thị form: nhập name + email
3. Guest nhập thông tin
4. System tạo conversation
5. Guest có thể gửi tin nhắn đầu tiên
end note
@enduml
